# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-05-14 16:15

translate chinese strings:

    # game/options.rpy:124
    old "{i}In this emotionally charged narrative-driven game, you step into the shoes of a protagonist who has endured the scars of high school bullying. Haunted by memories of a girl who made life unbearable, you've journeyed through both literal and metaphorical realms of heaven and hell, reshaping your identity and vowing for retribution. Yet, as adulthood dawns, you realize the futility of clinging to past grudges and choose a path of moving forward.\n\nBut fate has a twist in store. Your tranquil life is upended when the same high-school bully, along with her friends become your housemates, thanks to your guardian's new rental arrangements. Unprepared and unnerved, you brace for a resurgence of old conflicts. However, what unfolds is a journey far more profound and unexpected.\n\n\"My Bully is My Lover\" is a journey of healing, understanding, and the unexpected ways of life intertwine. Prepare to embark on a path where past pain paves the way for growth and unlikely bonds.{/i}"
    new "{i}在这款充满情感冲突的剧情驱动游戏里，你将扮演一位高中时期经受过惨痛霸凌的主角。那个让你的生活充满痛苦的女孩的记忆在你脑海里挥之不去，你经历了重重难关，改变了自己，发誓要报仇。但在成年之后，你认识到执着于过去的仇恨毫无作用，于是决定放下过去，继续生活。\n\n然而命运却没有那么简单。你的监护人决定把房子里的空房间租出去，于是当年霸凌你的女生和她的两个朋友居然成了你的室友，这完全打破了你平静的生活。你对此毫无准备，变得心神不宁，准备应对旧日冲突的复燃。然而，接下来发生的却是一段更加深刻且出乎你意料的故事。\n\n《我的爱人是霸凌女》是一段充满了治愈、互相理解以及生活的无常的旅途。在这里，你会认识到，过去的伤痛也能为成长以及意想不到的连结铺平道路。{/i}"

